# Copy to .env; `make run` and `make up` load it automatically. .env is gitignored.
# The admin password is not configured here: it is stored (hashed) in MongoDB
# and created on first visit to /admin/setup.

# MongoDB connection used by `make run`. The default points at the MongoDB
# container from `make mongo`; use mongodb://localhost:27017 for a local mongod,
# or a mongodb+srv:// URI for a hosted cluster.
# (`make up` always connects the app container to its bundled MongoDB.)
MONGODB_URI=mongodb://localhost:27018
MONGODB_DB=blog

# Optional overrides (defaults shown).
# PORT=8080
# Supported languages, default first. Keep in sync with frontend/src/lib/i18n.ts.
# LANGUAGES=en,id
